{"version":1,"content":"<p>歌手施匡翹（Zaina)昨日分享戴四方帽，宣布半工讀完成理工大學畢業，恭喜恭喜！</p><p>Zaina發文：「我終於畢業了，半工讀的生涯暫時完結，好感恩有一班很好的groupmates，大家都很認真每次project希望做到最好。</p><p>衷心覺得所有一邊工作一</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:22:16.202215+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:01:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T07:18:16.131972+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:18:16.131972+00:00","content_hash":"94063ab48f8d9418b2726ebc5a284c6ae18432dbf5b9de116f66bc811d1e18f0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}